WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:08.000
A recent survey has shown that up to 70&nbsp;
percent of our community is either concerned&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:11.040
or very concerned about climate change.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:17.360
The impact of climate change will put our&nbsp;
core infrastructure at risk, it will require&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:23.520
a rethink about where and how we build, what&nbsp;
goods we consume and overall how we operate.

00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:28.640
The council is working on a&nbsp;
climate change response strategy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:36.240
in support of New Zealand's and Waimakariri's&nbsp;
shift to a low emission future by 2050.

00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:43.120
We're expecting more direction from the&nbsp;
government soon, but it's clear that investing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:49.200
in a sustainable future now is going to&nbsp;
cost a lot less than taking no action.

00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:57.840
Visit waimakariri.govt.nz/letstalk&nbsp;
to find out more.

